                  <node index="2" text="Main Causes of Flooding" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" visible-to-user="true" bounds="[58,955][489,1002]" drawing-order="0" hint="" display-id="0" />
                  <node index="3" text="Recent official research reports consistently show that Bengaluru floods when heavy rainfall meets drainage system has lost capacity [16]. The city’s average annual rainfall was reported at 969 mm during 203–9, and recent studies note that intense rainfall events can overwhelm drains, especially where runoff has increased because of urbanization [2]." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" visible-to-user="true" bounds="[58,1033][1022,1446]" drawing-order="0" hint="" display-id="0" />
                  <node index="4" text="Rainfall" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" visible-to-user="true" bounds="[58,1504][254,1572]" drawing-order="0" hint="" display-id="0" />
                  <node index="5" text="Rainfall is the trigger, but not the sole cause. The ATREE action plan notes that higher rainfall intensity and changing rainfall patterns worsen flooding, while the Comptroller and Auditor General report says storm-water planning did not adequately account for high-intensity rainfall rainfall under rapid urban growth." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" visible-to-user="true" bounds="[58,1609][1022,1961]" drawing-order="0" hint="" display-id="0" />
                  <node index="6" text="Drainage" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" visible-to-user="true" bounds="[58,1992][213,2039]" drawing-order="0" hint="" display-id="0" />
                  <node index="7" text="Drainage failure is a central factor. The CAG report found large-scale encroachment of lakes and drains, poor maintenance missing drain drain inventories and sewage mixing with stormwater; it also said many drains lacked boundary markings, enabled encroachment and blockage . Research on Bengaluru similarly states that natural channels have been narrowed or blocked and artificial drains are often blocked [188][]." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" visible-to-user="true" bounds="[58,2070][1022,2520]" drawing-order="0" hint="" display-id="0" />
